Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Message Boards|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Message Boards|
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
		|portletName|Message Boards|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Edit Page
		|page|Message Boards Page|
	And Page edit Page Layout Column
		|columnName|1 Column|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Message Boards|
	Then Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add MB Categories
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	And MessageboardsCategory add PG
		|categoryName|MB Category1 Name|
	And MessageboardsCategory view PG
		|categoryName|MB Category1 Name|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	And MessageboardsCategory add PG
		|categoryName|MB Category2 Name|
	And MessageboardsCategory view PG
		|categoryName|MB Category2 Name|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	And MessageboardsCategory add PG
		|categoryName|MB Category3 Name|
	Then MessageboardsCategory view PG
		|categoryName|MB Category3 Name|
