		|pageName|Message Boards Page|
	And these variables
		|key_threadStatus|Draft|
	And these variables
		|key_threadSubject|Message Boards Thread Draft|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Message Boards Thread Draft' at locator 'MessageBoards#THREAD_LIST_THREAD'
